 Start Your Career in B2B Sales 
 Are you confident speaking with people, motivated by goals, and interested in developing real-world sales skills?
 INKAS® Payments is looking for ambitious and persistent individuals to join our Montreal sales team as  B2B Lead Generation Specialists .
 This is an  outbound prospecting role . Your primary responsibility will be connecting with Canadian businesses by phone, identifying potential customers, generating interest in our payment solutions, and creating qualified opportunities for our sales team.
